es\"><span>merge</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  splices nodes from another container <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Lookup\">Lookup </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/count\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>count</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of elements matching specific key <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/find\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>find</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds element with specific key <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/contains\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>contains</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks if the container contains element with specific key <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/equal_range\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>equal_range</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns range of elements matching a specific key <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Bucket_interface\">Bucket interface </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/unordered_multimap/begin2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>beg